.SH DESCRIPTION
The structures in a QTabBar.
.PP
For custom QTabBar tab headings.
.PP
See also QTabBar.
.SH MEMBER FUNCTION DOCUMENTATION
.SH "QTab::QTab ()"
Constructs an empty tab. All fields are set to empty.
.SH "QTab::QTab ( const QIconSet & icon, const QString & text = QString::null )"
Constructs a tab with an \fIicon\fR and a \fItext.\fR
.SH "QTab::QTab ( const QString & text )"
Constructs a tab with a \fItext.\fR
.SH "QTab::~QTab () \fC[virtual]\fR"
Destructs the tab and frees up all allocated resources.
